{
    "response": "The Climate Pledge is a commitment co-founded by Amazon in 2019 to reach net-zero carbon emissions across global operations by 2040[^1:doc-5501c9cdfc7b318b264a674230dfa432§root¶287cc6a64ac815058d91f76aa46e9e84]. \n\nIt functions as a global coalition designed to bring together companies, drive collective action, and foster cross-sector collaboration toward industry-wide decarbonization. Signatories to the pledge must adhere to three core commitments:\n* Regularly report their greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions.\n* Implement operational changes to actively decarbonize their businesses.\n* Neutralize any remaining emissions with credible offsets.\n\nThrough this framework, the Climate Pledge encourages companies from diverse sectors to engage in shared initiatives and work collectively toward climate mitigation goals.",
